  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Running long distances isn‚Äôt just about endurance‚Äîit‚Äôs about training smart and choosing shoes that support every mile! Meet the ASICS Gel Cumulus 27‚Äîbuilt to make your running workouts feel smoother, lighter, and more effortless with every step.The FF BLAST PLUS cushioning and PureGEL technology are strategically positioned in the midsole to ensure softer landings and a more energized toe-off with every stride. Constructed with an upper featuring at least 75% recycled content, these shoes let you stay committed to the planet and your fitness journey. Fuel your runs with the ASICS Gel Cumulus 27.</p> <p><strong>ASICS Gel Cumulus 27 </strong><strong>features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Engineered mesh upper offers breathability and comfort.</li> <li>Reflective details ensure visibility in low-light conditions.</li> <li>OrthoLite X-30 sockliner provides all-day comfort.</li> <li>FLUIDRIDE outsole delivers superior traction and durability.</li> </ul> <p><strong>*</strong>Sockliner produced with the solution dyeing process reduces water usage by approximately 33% and carbon emissions by approximately 45% compared to conventional dyeing technology.</p><hr /><p>Daily miles and long hours on your feet feel easier when your shoes deliver soft landings and steady support. The ASICS Gel Cumulus 27 pairs a smooth, lightweight ride with comfort-focused cushioning, making it a strong choice for runners and everyday wear alike.</p><ul><li>Engineered mesh upper for breathable comfort</li><li>FF BLAST PLUS cushioning and PureGEL technology help create softer landings and energized toe-offs</li><li>OrthoLite X-30 sockliner adds all-day comfort</li><li>FLUIDRIDE outsole is built for traction and durability</li><li>Reflective details and an upper made with at least 75% recycled content</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>Most reviewers highlight the comfortable, supportive feel. For the best fit, we recommend starting with your usual size; if you prefer a little extra room through the forefoot, trying the next half size may feel more comfortable.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for daily running, walking, and anyone who wants cushioned comfort with dependable support throughout the day.</p>  <p><strong>Cushioning &amp; Road Feel</strong></p><p>Soft cushioning is the standout here, with FF BLAST PLUS foam and PureGEL helping each step feel smoother and more forgiving. Reviewers also call out the stable, flexible feel, giving the ride a balanced mix of comfort and control.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p><p>Some runners note the shoe benefits from a few wears to fully settle in, especially if you are coming from a softer previous version. The supportive platform is built for regular training, and runners logging heavy mileage may want to monitor outsole wear over time.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® Gel Cumulus 27 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Concrete</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1012B772-002</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official ASICS® shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 39.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.1</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-alig